.TH KEYLATCH\-PROXY 1 "2026-05-13" "keylatch" "Keylatch Manual"
.SH NAME
keylatch\-proxy \- start or configure the local credential proxy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keylatch proxy
.RI [ flags ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBkeylatch proxy\fR starts a local credential proxy that mediates credential
access between AI agents and external services. The proxy implements the
\fIgateway_proxy\fR runtime mode, providing an additional layer of audit and
access control for multi-agent workflows.
.PP
Full implementation is planned for Phase 8+. The command is currently
registered to support shell completion and future flags.
.SH OPTIONS
No stable flags defined yet. Pass \fB\-\-help\fR to see available options.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 5
Not yet implemented.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR keylatch (1),
.BR keylatch\-run (1),
.BR keylatch\-sandbox (1)
